posts.text:
This weekend was a nightmare for travelers across the country. I’m grateful to the air traffic controllers, airport staff, flight attendants, pilots, and TSA agents who have worked around the clock to help passengers and get flights moving again after the FAA ground stop was lifted.

Even under the toughest circumstances, these dedicated workers show up to help travelers reach their destinations safely. I will always stand with our union workers—because strong unions build stronger communities.

@AFGENational, @transportworker, @alpapilots, @NATCA, @afa_cwa, @IAM_Union

The discharge petition for the Major Richard Star Act has reached 218 bipartisan signatures. It’s time for a vote.

I’m proud to support this bill so eligible combat-injured veterans can receive the full retirement pay and disability benefits they’ve earned.

@SpeakerJohnson,

